# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Nivavale — environment variables (example)
#
# 1. Copy this file to `.env.local` for local development:
#       copy .env.example .env.local
# 2. Fill in real values.
# 3. Never commit `.env.local` or any real secrets to the repository.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Contact form endpoint.
# When empty, the contact form does not submit and shows a "not connected"
# notice instead. To connect a form service (e.g. Formspree, Basin, or your
# own API/Worker), set this to its POST endpoint.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_ENDPOINT="https://formspree.io/f/your-form-id"
